title: Typing, enter, tab, backspace at a line start and delete at a line end write exactly that
folders: plain
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-log: saved .*util\.rs
expect-file: plain/src/util.rs :: (?-i)\A// top\npub fn double\(n: u32\) -> u32 \{\n    n \* 2\n    x\n        y\n\}\npub fn triple\(n: u32\) -> u32 \{\n    n \* 3\}\n\z

wait 3000
edit src/util.rs 1 1
type // top
key enter
edit src/util.rs 3 1
key end
key enter
type x
key enter
key tab
type y
edit src/util.rs 8 1
key backspace
edit src/util.rs 8 100
key delete
wait 400
mark typed
wait 500
key save
wait 600
mark saved
wait 500
quit
